# Template only -- lists the variable names this stack's docker-compose.yml
# expects. Real values live in Infisical, never here and never in git.
# scripts/render-env.sh writes the actual .env next to this file on the host.
#
# This stack's currently ACTIVE `mc` service consumes no environment
# variables at all (EULA is hardcoded to "TRUE"). The original
# setupmc.com-generated service definition -- which did use a
# MANAGEMENT_SERVER_SECRET variable to connect to a setupmc.com remote
# management server -- is kept as a commented-out block at the top of
# docker-compose.yml for reference, but isn't active. If that managed
# integration is ever re-enabled, MANAGEMENT_SERVER_SECRET will need to be
# added back here.
